        - Output: :math:`(N, C, H_{out})` or :math:`(C, H_{out})`, where

          .. math::
              H_{out} = (H_{in} - 1) \times \text{stride}[0] - 2 \times \text{padding}[0] + \text{kernel\_size}[0]

          or as given by :attr:`output_size` in the call operator

